{"id": "16-2799-2-9", "zh": "用于施设，同样用于时间，用于最长的寿量，以及用于切断；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2800-2-7", "zh": "用于周遍，用于言说，也用于信受；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2801-2-7", "zh": "用于运用，用于律的作法，也用于借口；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2802-2-5", "zh": "用于抉择、中劫，用于贪爱、邪见与阿僧祇劫；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2803-2-9", "zh": "以及用于劫等等，kappa 一词就用在这些意义上。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2804-2-4", "zh": "kapi，行走义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2804-5-11", "zh": "kampeti、kampayati，意思是“走”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2804-12-16", "zh": "这些形式与用于“动摇”义的使役主动形式相似。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2804-17-34", "zh": "因为在“动摇”义上，由“kampa，动摇义”这一词根，构成“kampati”这一不及物的单纯主动形式；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2804-35-58", "zh": "而“kampeti”等是及物的使役主动形式，因为可以见到不及物词根构成及物形式，如“这又是第二支箭，震动了我的心”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2805-2-4", "zh": "khapi，忍耐义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2805-5-8", "zh": "khampeti、khampayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2806-2-4", "zh": "thūpa，隆起义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2806-5-8", "zh": "隆起，就是升高、高耸。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2806-9-12", "zh": "thūpeti、thūpayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2806-13-16", "zh": "thūpo（塔）、thūpikā（小塔）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2807-2-4", "zh": "tapa，消耗义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2807-5-8", "zh": "tapeti、tapayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2808-2-4", "zh": "upa，到达义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2808-5-8", "zh": "upeti、upayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2809-2-4", "zh": "capa，捣碎义。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "16-2809-5-8", "zh": "capeti、capayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2810-2-4", "zh": "suppa，量度义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2810-5-8", "zh": "suppeti、suppayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2811-2-5", "zh": "ḍapa、ḍipa，聚集义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2811-6-7", "zh": "ḍāpeti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2811-8-9", "zh": "ḍāpayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2811-10-13", "zh": "ḍepeti、ḍepayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2812-2-5", "zh": "kapa，怜悯义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2812-6-9", "zh": "kapeti、kapayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2812-10-11", "zh": "kapaṇo（可怜人）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2812-12-15", "zh": "**kapaṇo**，就是应当被怜悯的人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2812-16-26", "zh": "但在别处，人们说的是“kappati”这一形式。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2813-2-6", "zh": "gupa、kupa、dhūpa，照耀义。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "16-2813-7-10", "zh": "gopeti、gopayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2813-11-14", "zh": "kopeti、kopayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2813-15-18", "zh": "dhūpeti、dhūpayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2814-2-4", "zh": "kipa，虚弱义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2814-5-8", "zh": "kipeti、kipayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2815-2-4", "zh": "khepa，推动义。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2815-5-11", "zh": "推动，就是碾成粉末。khepeti、khepayati。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-2816-2-4", "zh": "tapa，满足义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2816-5-8", "zh": "tapeti、tapayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2817-2-4", "zh": "āpu，悬挂义。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2817-5-8", "zh": "āpeti、āpayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2817-9-10", "zh": "āpo（水）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2818-2-4", "zh": "tapa，燃烧义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2818-5-8", "zh": "tapeti、tapayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2818-9-12", "zh": "tapo（苦行）、tāpo（热）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2818-13-16", "zh": "ātāpo（热诚）、santāpo（热恼）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2818-17-22", "zh": "在使役式中：tāpeti、tāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2818-23-31", "zh": "其中，**tapo**，是因为它能烧灼诸不善法，所以称为 tapo，就是戒。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2819-2-4", "zh": "opa、thapa，安置义。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-2819-5-8", "zh": "opeti、opayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2819-9-13", "zh": "它们不往仓库里储存。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2819-14-17", "zh": "thapeti、thapayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2819-18-19", "zh": "thapito（被安置的）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2819-20-23", "zh": "放下遮盖物后，加以确定。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-2819-24-25", "zh": "voṭṭhabbanaṃ（确定）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2820-2-17", "zh": "这里的拆分是“vi ava thapeti，vi ava thapanaṃ”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2820-18-27", "zh": "其中，前一个形式是省略元音，tha 变为 ṭha，并以异类辅音的方式重叠。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2820-28-57", "zh": "后一个形式则是省略元音，ava 变为 o，tha 变为 ṭha，pa 变为 va，va 重叠，两个 va 再变为两个 ba。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2820-58-63", "zh": "voṭṭhabbana 是确定心的名称。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2820-64-75", "zh": "省略 na 时，还有另一个形式“voṭṭhabba”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2821-2-4", "zh": "māpa，建造义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2821-5-9", "zh": "建造草庵：māpeti、māpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2821-10-15", "zh": "“凡是杀生的人”；“草庵建得很好”。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2822-2-4", "zh": "yapa，维持义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2822-5-7", "zh": "维持，就是延续下去。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2822-8-12", "zh": "他靠那个在那里维持生活。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2822-13-14", "zh": "yāpayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2822-15-16", "zh": "yāpanā（维持）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2823-2-13", "zh": "其中，**yāpeti** 这个词，在 yā 词根带有使役意义时，是使役形式。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2823-14-25", "zh": "因为可以在圣典中见到“uyyāpenti nāma”这样的文句。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2824-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 pa 结尾的词根形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2825-2-5", "zh": "以 pha 结尾的词根形式并不常见。", "confidence": 75}
